These tokens help the transformer model better understand the structure of input and output sequences, enhancing its ability to learn and generate coherent text. In the context of blockchain, BOS and EOS tokens can be used as a part of smart contracts or in developing decentralized applications, but their roles and uses are not directly related to transformer models.
