5. Ongoing Support: The human support agent takes over the conversation and addresses the user's concerns in-depth. Once the issue has been resolved, the agent can use the chatbot again to follow-up and ensure the user's satisfaction with the support provided.

6. Continuous Improvement: With the help of analytics and user feedback, the e-sports company continuously improves the chatbot's performance and adds new capabilities. This ensures that the chatbot becomes smarter and more adept at handling a vast array of user queries over time, further streamlining the support process.

